{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53408","headline":"奉酬窦三中丞见赠 · 刘伯翁","name":"奉酬窦三中丞见赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"多幸尝陪侍玉墀，俄惊负谴阻天涯。\n今日相逢问荣悴，更嗟年辈飒然衰。\n（见《窦氏联珠集·窦羣》附）（按：窦羣诗题爲《赠刘大兄院长》，刘诗下署「金州员外司马刘伯翁」。\n岑仲勉先生《唐人行第录》疑即两《唐书》皆有传之刘伯刍，然二书均未载伯刍贬金州事，尚无从定论。\n今仍题作刘伯翁，俟考详。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘伯翁","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53408.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53408","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}